# a-record-a-variant-and-a-constant

A record, a variant and a constant are printed as written, under their kind,
the comments above their fields and cases with them, then what documents
them; a function with no comment is printed with its call alone (spec § 1;
panel 253's R2).

## record Point

    record Point
        # Across, in cells.
        x: i64
        # Down, in cells.
        y: i64

A point on a grid.

## variant Heading

    variant Heading
        # Up the grid.
        north
        # Down it, by so many cells.
        south
            cells: i64

Where a move goes.

## constant WIDEST

    constant WIDEST: i64
        64

The widest grid.

## function moved

    function moved(p: Point, cells: i64) -> Point

    moved(p, cells)
